Hi {Owner},

I build websites for pet sitters, dog walkers and mobile vets around {City}. {Business Name} has warm reviews and visit posts, but no site where an owner can check your area, read how you handle keys and request a visit.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a service-area map with travel fees, a meet-and-greet or house-call request, a key and home security policy and a sample visit report, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone between visits?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
